<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>On the entire earth, in the whole universe,</l><l>I have no int’rest or other desire:</l><l>My desire is only You.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thank You, dearest Lord; You’ve predestinated me.</l><l>You’ve called me and saved me and, Lord, preserved me.</l><l>You have brought me, Lord, to this day.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
